    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "So, you know, and I've told several people this, what a small world it is that you and I, in fact, went to the same high school. So they always say the connections you make in high school, especially at Catholic High, will always serve you in the future. So it's great to have a fellow Bruin involved in this space with me.",
