    "turn_text": "Right, and along those lines, actually next week, we were originally scheduled to have our Luis first, hopefully our first able Louisiana UAS symposium, which of course you generously offer to provide the keynote before going to have, you know, industry leaders from various industries, as well as government agencies. It was going to be a great event, but, you know, something that's got to be in a nine, kind of, you know, dampered our plans for that, but it will be back in full force next year. We're determined to have it. Certainly, I would hope that this situation has changed by then and that people are more willing and confident that they can safely attend conferences. So I look forward to working with you in the Louisiana Department of Transportation Development to host that summit. So one of the last things I wanted to ask you about is what exactly do you, how do you, well first of all, how are you enjoying your tenure and progress, but of course more relevant to your conversation today, specifically how are you enjoying being on the aviation subcommittee?",
